  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "浏览器 · Laoboshi DSH Plugin",
      "text": "为劳博士 DSH 桌面客户端提供浏览器预览与 BrowserOps 控制面板。\n\n> The v0.1.0 UI uses native host capabilities supplied by Laoboshi Desktop. Stock DSH Web shows a compatibility notice."
    },
    {
      "section": "Install",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Modole/dsh-plugin-browserops-laoboshi.git\n```\n\nRestart `dsh web` after installation. DSH reads the `dsh.bundle` manifest and adds this package to the selected profile."
    },
    {
      "section": "Origin and author",
      "text": "Extracted from the built-in capability in [Laoboshi Agent Studio](https://github.com/Modole/laobos-agent-studio). Author: Modole."
    },
    {
      "section": "Security",
      "text": "Plugins execute with the current user's permissions. Review the source before installation and never post credentials, SSH private keys, or local runtime databases in issues."
    },
    {
      "section": "License",
      "text": "MIT"
    },
    {
      "section": "浏览器 · 劳博士 DSH 插件",
      "text": "为劳博士 DSH 桌面客户端提供浏览器预览与 BrowserOps 控制面板。\n\n> 当前 v0.1.0 的交互界面依赖劳博士 Desktop 提供的原生宿主桥接；在普通 DSH Web 中会显示兼容性提示。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh plugin --profile web add https://github.com/Modole/dsh-plugin-browserops-laoboshi.git\n```\n\n安装后重启 `dsh web`。DSH 会读取 `dsh.bundle` manifest，并自动把本插件加入当前 profile。"
    },
    {
      "section": "来源与作者",
      "text": "本插件从 [劳博士 Agent Studio](https://github.com/Modole/laobos-agent-studio) 的内置能力独立整理而来。作者：Modole。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安全",
      "text": "插件代码以当前用户权限运行。安装前请审阅源码；不要把密钥、SSH 私钥或本机运行数据库提交到 Issue。"
    },
    {
